<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>A Secret Message ❤️</title>

<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;}

body{
height:100vh;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff6b81,#ff8fab,#ffc2d1);
overflow:hidden;
}

#envelope{
width:320px;
height:220px;
background:#fff;
position:relative;
border-radius:10px;
cursor:pointer;
box-shadow:0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
transition:.8s;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
text-align:center;
}

#envelope:before{
content:"";
position:absolute;
top:0;
left:0;
width:100%;
height:100%;
clip-path:polygon(0 0,50% 55%,100% 0);
background:#ffd6de;
}

#cover{
position:absolute;
z-index:5;
color:#444;
font-size:24px;
font-weight:bold;
}

#letter{
position:absolute;
width:90%;
max-width:520px;
padding:35px;
background:white;
border-radius:15px;
box-shadow:0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
display:none;
text-align:center;
animation:fade .8s;
}

#letter h1{
color:#ff4f81;
margin-bottom:15px;
}

#letter p{
font-size:20px;
line-height:1.8;
color:#555;
}

button{
margin-top:25px;
padding:12px 25px;
border:none;
background:#ff4f81;
color:white;
border-radius:30px;
font-size:18px;
cursor:pointer;
}

#final{
display:none;
text-align:center;
color:white;
animation:fade 1s;
}

#final h1{
font-size:55px;
}

#final p{
font-size:24px;
margin-top:20px;
}

.heart{
position:absolute;
color:white;
font-size:25px;
animation:float 8s linear infinite;
opacity:.7;
}

@keyframes float{
from{transform:translateY(100vh);}
to{transform:translateY(-120vh);}
}

@keyframes fade{
from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.9);}
to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1);}
}
</style>

</head>
<body>

<div id="envelope" onclick="openLetter()">
<div id="cover">
💌<br><br>
To:<br>
<b>APARNA ❤️</b><br><br>
Tap to Open
</div>
</div>

<div id="letter">

<h1>My Dearest Aparna ❤️</h1>

<p>

I don't have a long story to tell today...

<br><br>

I just wanted to remind you of one simple thing...

<br><br>

❤️ <b>I MISS YOU A LOT.</b> ❤️

<br><br>

Every smile reminds me of you.

Every heartbeat whispers your name.

Every day feels incomplete without you.

<br><br>

If you're reading this...

Please smile... 😊

Because someone is thinking about you right now.

<br><br>

Forever Yours,

<br><br>

❤️ <b>SONU</b> ❤️

</p>

<button onclick="showFinal()">❤️ Tap Here ❤️</button>

</div>

<div id="final">

<h1>❤️</h1>

<p>

Can't wait to see you again...

<br><br>

You Mean Everything To Me.

<br><br>

❤️ SONU ❤️

</p>

</div>

<script>

function openLetter(){

document.getElementById("envelope").style.display="none";

document.getElementById("letter").style.display="block";

}

function showFinal(){

document.getElementById("letter").style.display="none";

document.getElementById("final").style.display="block";

}

for(let i=0;i<35;i++){

let h=document.createElement("div");

h.className="heart";

h.innerHTML="❤";

h.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";

h.style.fontSize=(15+Math.random()*25)+"px";

h.style.animationDuration=(5+Math.random()*6)+"s";

h.style.animationDelay=(-Math.random()*8)+"s";

document.body.appendChild(h);

}

</script>

</body>
</html>
